  "//geometry": [
    "Doom's contrast trick, taken literally: ambient 0.12 and a 30-block fog wall,",
    "so a demon is only ever a silhouette against the one lit thing near it. Every",
    "light source in this level is a neon bank or a lava vent, and each one is a",
    "landmark you navigate by.",
    "",
    "  R1  landing       x  6..18  z  6..18   y8..14   (spawn)",
    "  C1  dark spine    x 11..13  z 19..40   y8..11",
    "  A1  alcove        x  6..10  z 24..26            ambush",
    "  A2  alcove        x 14..18  z 30..32            ambush",
    "  A3  alcove        x  6..10  z 36..38            ambush + secret 1 behind x 5",
    "  R2  generator     x  6..30  z 41..58   y8..20   THE lit room",
    "  C2  sluice        x 28..30  z 59..76   y8..11",
    "  R3  sump          x  6..40  z 77..90   y8..15   flooded, BLUE keycard",
    "  C3  east drain    x 41..60  z 84..86   y8..11",
    "  R4  cistern       x 61..90  z 70..90   y8..17   lava-lit",
    "  ST  stair         x 61..65  z 70..76   rises y8 -> y14 inside R4",
    "  C4  high duct     x 62..64  z 55..69   y15..19",
    "  GAL gallery       x 32..64  z 48..54   y15..20  (backpack, secret 2)",
    "  W1  window        x 31      z 50..52   y15..17  -> a 7-block drop into R2",
    "  D1  BLUE DOOR     x 19      z 10..12   y8..11   east wall of the landing",
    "  C5  vault throat  x 20..44  z 10..12   y8..11",
    "  R5  exit vault    x 45..90  z  4..34   y8..18   exit + exit switch",
    "",
    "The gallery is a one-way return: from the generator room the window is seven",
    "blocks up bare rock. So the exit vault is behind the blue keycard, and the",
    "keycard is at the bottom of the sump at the far end of the map."
  ],

